    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I reproduced this on latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.12 (!at least latest Nightly build!)\n\n### Description\n\nWhen I use nvim locally, my colorscheme works without any problems.\nHowever, when I connect to the same machine over SSH and run nvim, the colorscheme is not applied correctly.\n\n* Local environment: Warp\n* Remote environment: Devian over SSH\n* Terminal $TERM locally and over SSH: xterm-256color\n\nI add `vim.opt.termguicolors = true` on `init.lua` file so that the same colorscheme works correctly when using nvim over SSH.\n\n### Reproduction\n\nnothing",
